# Dreadhorde Arcanist's "mana value less than or equal to this creature's power" reads its power as it is (CR 208.3, 613.4c),
# not its printed 1. Faithless Looting on turn 1 discards a Lightning Bolt (mana value 1) and a Lightning Strike (2). On turn
# 5 Giant Growth makes the Arcanist 4/6 before combat; it attacks, and its trigger targets the Strike, which a power of 1
# could not. The Strike is cast for no mana at Bot2 and exiled as it resolves; the Bolt stays in the graveyard. Bot2 takes 3
# from the Strike and 4 from the Arcanist.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Dreadhorde Arcanist
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Strike
Giant Growth
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Lightning Strike)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dreadhorde Arcanist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Dreadhorde Arcanist)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Dreadhorde Arcanist)
Bot1.Target(Lightning Strike)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dreadhorde Arcanist.Power = 4
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Strike
Bot1.Graveyard = Giant Growth; Faithless Looting; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Life = 13
